h Infantry Division in several European battles and campaigns, in France, Belgium, Luxembourg and Germany, for which it received numerous awards for valor in combat. The regiment was retired in 1946, but reactivated in 1947 and is still active today.","LocalizedString":"The 12th Infantry Regiment was formed in 1861 and has been a unit of the US Army to the present day. On D-Day, 1944, the regiment spearheaded the landing assault on Utah Beach in Normandy with the 4th Infantry Division. During WWII the regiment fought with the 4th Infantry Division in several European battles and campaigns, in France, Belgium, Luxembourg and Germany, for which it received numerous awards for valor in combat. The regiment was retired in 1946, but reactivated in 1947 and is still active today."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Expansion2019","isInPermanentPool":true,"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Deployment"],"hasDeployment":true,"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion_Medium'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/Explosion_Medium.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/USA/CandidateArtwork/t_grenade_dude.t_grenade_dude","SubPathString":""},"artist":"US WWII Poster","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/12th_INFANTRY_REGIMENT.12th_INFANTRY_REGIMENT","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":396.0},"historyPhotoSource":"US Navy","historyPhotoIdentificationCode":"SC 190062","historyPhotoAuthor":"Army Signal Corps","historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_12th_infantry_regiment_photo","SourceString":"4th Infantry Division move off the Utah Beachhead on D-Day, 1944.","LocalizedString":"4th Infantry Division move off the Utah Beachhead on D-Day, 1944."},"historyTypeDescription":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_12th_infantry_regiment_header","SourceString":"Infantry","LocalizedString":"Infantry"},"blowUpExplosionNiaga